Z||000000||Wolfhound||04-13-2001||09:03 AM||||Jim and Mark a couple of friends of mine in Huntsville are fielding a Hobby stock car at Huntsville Speedway.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/clean.JPG"> <BR>I,ll never tell who the comedian was that secretly put the smiley faces on the car.<P>Mark drove to a checkered flag on his second time out. Look at this grin.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Markcollins.jpg"> <BR>The is a photo of crew.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/crew.jpg"> ||||reg||1
